//
// Covers: the collision primitive, wall/paddle/brick bounces (face, corner,
// seam), tunneling resistance, the paddle dead angle, speed conservation,
// dt-independence and score/combo bookkeeping. The boot() loop (DOM) is not
// exercised here.
//
// Run: `node --test "game/**/*.test.js"`  (or `npm test`)

